OL,3,GNEWSARoadworks delay will 'bring sense
OL,4,Aof relief'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision to postpone the final
OL,7,Fsection of a major roadworks project in
OL,8,FJersey is good news because it will
OL,9,Fgive the community a break from
OL,10,Fdisruption, a politician says.
OL,12,FRenewal of 2km (1.2 miles) of the sewer
OL,13,Fnetwork has closed sections of a major
OL,14,Froad connecting St Helier with northern
OL,15,Fparishes since November 2025.
OL,17,FThe final part of works were now not
OL,18,Fgoing forward while improvements at
OL,19,FMaufant, for a new housing development,
OL,20,Fwere being prioritised, Infrastructure
OL,21,FMinister Jonathan Renouf said.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
