OL,3,GNEWSARoadworks delay will 'bring sense
OL,4,Aof relief'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Hilary Jeune, who scrutinises
OL,7,Finfrastructure, said the delay would
OL,8,Falso be a chance to make sure the
OL,9,Fremainder of the work was a "smoother
OL,10,Fprocess" with better government
OL,11,Fcommunication.
